  m_Text: 'On edges of skycrapers, on top of mountains, rooftops of homes, tower
    tops, buildings intersections, building edges on the bottom side etc. You will
    notice that angles would cover those shapes and borders well. As the game proceeds
    some of the places might seem unusual for angles fitting, again observe edges
    and geometrical shapes. Be creative! '
